    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the translation_client.py file, I need to write code that includes local configuration and client helper utilities for General Text Translation. I will use the Amazon Translate service for this task, as it is a concrete third-party managed service for text translation. I will import the necessary modules from the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python. I will also include environment variables for AWS access key and secret key for authentication. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789850330623,
          "start": 1789850327843
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
