      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To fulfill the user's request, I need to create a Python script that translates dictionary values while preserving keys. I will use the Google Translate API for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that can be identified in the code by its specific client class and API endpoint. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789850325090,
          "start": 1789850323542
