      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `translate_markup.py` that translates HTML or markup while preserving tags, I need to use a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Translate service, which is identifiable by the `boto3` library and the specific service name `translate`. </thinking>\n",
