        "text": "<thinking> To create the `batch_translate.py` script, I need to integrate a concrete external translation service. I will use the Google Translate API, which is a well-known and widely used service for translation tasks. The script will take a list of strings as input, translate them using the Google Translate API, and return the translated strings while preserving the order. </thinking>\n",
